@startuml coupon-merchant-create-activity
title 创建和发布优惠券模板

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif"
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  DiamondBackgroundColor #F0F9FF
  DiamondBorderColor #3B82F6
  StartColor #16A34A
  EndColor #EF4444
  ArrowColor #475569
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  TitleBackgroundColor #E2E8F0
}

|商家|

start

:填写模板信息;

:创建草稿;

:编辑草稿;

:提交发布;

|优惠券服务|

:校验规则\n并冻结核心配置;

if (校验通过?) then (否)
  :返回失败;
  stop
else (是)
endif

:发布模板;

|数据库|

:写入模板与状态流水;

stop

@enduml
